WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.060
Night Manager: If he hands you a ticket,
  don't take it.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.860
Mica: Nora's last text came from this
  pier.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.010
Rae: She said the carousel was moving.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.180
Dev: This place has been shut since
  October.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.160
Jules: That's him. Same coat from Nora's
  picture.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.820
Mica: You're the one she saw.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.200
Silas Vale: Everyone sees me eventually.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.261
Mica: Dev, stay where I can see you.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.280
Dev: I'm right here!

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.360
Rae: I can still hear the music.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.080
Rae: These names go back fifty years.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.881
Mica: Nora's picture looks brand new.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.840
Jules: Why would they pin it up here?

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.160
Mica: Don't look in the mirrors.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.905
Rae: I already did. He's in every one.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.680
Silas Vale: You should be getting home.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.563
Nora (Phone): Mica, if you found my phone,
  don't come looking for me.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.380
Mica: Nora? Can you hear me?

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.600
Jules: Mica, I didn't even move—

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.389
Mica: Rae, take my hand. Don't let go.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.540
Rae: I've got you.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.560
Rae: Mica, something's pulling me!

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:16.980
Mica: Rae!

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.480
Mica: It took all of them.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.640
Silas Vale: One ticket left.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.340
Mica: Where did the stairs go?

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.520
Mica: Nora! Dev! Jules! Rae! Can you hear
  me?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.079
Mica: If Nora's still here, give me a
  sign.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.720
Silas Vale: She never left.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.140
Silas Vale: There's always room for one
  more.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.000
Mica: No!

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.860
Silas Vale: You were always on the list.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:56.840
Nora (Tent): Mica?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.200
Night Manager: Last ride.
